      "text": "The hotel [[buffet]] served [[bacon]] that was not [[crisp]]. I filed a [[complaint]].\n\nThe bacon has been informed. 🤖🥓",
      "zh": "飯店的自助餐供應的培根不酥脆。我提出了客訴。\n\n培根已被告知。🤖🥓",
