      "text": "Grandson told me to [[download]] the app and [[install]] it. 我照做了 🙏\n\nIt was very [[convenient]]! Now I can order tomatoes AND get scolded by the app. 🍅📱",
      "zh": "孫子叫我下載這個應用程式然後安裝。我照做了 🙏\n\n真的很方便！現在我可以訂番茄，還會被應用程式唸。🍅📱",
