      "topic": "Business",
      "text": "The annual [[conference]] for flowers is next week. Our top [[candidate]] for \"Best Supplier\" is me.\n\nPlease vote. The [[manager]] of the garden is watching. 🐝🌼",
      "zh": "下週是花朵們的年度會議。「最佳供應者」的最佳人選是我。\n\n請投票。花園的經理正在看。🐝🌼",
