      "topic": "Philosophy",
      "text": "A big [[crowd]] stood at the market today 🍑 I asked, \"What is it?\" Nobody knew. 大家都只是在看別人看什麼 😂\n\nThen I saw a [[female]] singer. She was [[extremely]] good! I joined the crowd too and clapped 🎤",
