      "text": "今天在花園 I tried to plant roses for my art project. My [[pursuit]] of beauty ended with dirt on my face 😭\n\n我以為會很浪漫, but the sun was so hot that my cheeks had a red [[flush]]. 這不是藝術，是曬傷 💅",
