      "text": "Gym 今天 I saw a guy eat [[whole_wheat]] bread with peanut butter after his workout 🏋️\n\nI thought it was a [[horrible]] snack. 但他說 it is a gym [[legend]]: easy, cheap and full of energy. 好吧我錯了 🏄",
